Privacy Policy

Effective Date: [14/04/2025]

1. Introduction

Squat Workout and Stopwatch ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle your information when you use our application (the "App").

2. Information We Do Not Collect

The App does not collect, store, or transfer any personal data or other user information to our servers or any third party. All data entered into the App, including one-rep max inputs, is stored locally on your device.

3. Data Stored Locally

The App allows you to input and store one-rep max information directly on your device. This data is saved locally and is not accessible by us or any third party.

4. Permissions

The App does not request any permissions. Specifically, the App does not request access to your contacts, location, camera, or other sensitive device features.

5. Your Choices and Control

Since all data is stored locally on your device, you have full control over it. You may delete the data at any time by clearing the App’s storage or uninstalling the App.

6. Security

We take reasonable measures to ensure the App operates securely on your device. However, the security of data stored locally on your device depends on the security measures you implement, such as device passwords or encryption.

7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected in the updated version within the App. Please review this policy periodically to stay informed about how we protect your information.

8. Contact Us

If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or the App, please contact us at wl234.inbox@gmail.com.

By using the App, you agree to this Privacy Policy.
